Package: flexsae
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Non-Linear Small Area Estimation for Area-Level Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ridson", "Al Farizal P", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "alfrzlp@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0617-0214"))
Description: Small area estimation for area-level data when the relationship
    between the target and the covariates is non-linear: a semiparametric
    Fay-Herriot model with penalized splines and a Fay-Herriot model combined
    with random forests (Bukhari et al., 2026, <doi:10.18280/isi.310604>), both
    with parametric bootstrap mean squared error estimation, and benchmarking
    of the estimates to aggregate targets with the mean squared error of the
    benchmarked estimates, selection of covariates, partial dependence and
    'ggplot2' visualizations. The package is under development.
License: GPL (>= 3)
